WEBVTT

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:06.434
Choose Add, then Split, and pick where it goes in the reel.

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:17.834
Choose Side by side for two videos at once, then pick the video and the part for the first cell.

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:27.117
Each cell has its own Select page. Choose a different moment for the second cell.

00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:37.767
Play the split to see both parts playing together in one picture.
